
OpenDisplay iMac, live stick. This is the console (Ctrl+Alt+F2).

  Ctrl+Alt+F1                    back to the display session; once there:
  Ctrl+Alt+1 / 2 / 3             Mac display / gaming / desktop
                                 (the number keys, not F1 to F3)

  odimac-doctor                  check panel, decoding, Thunderbolt, receiver
  odimac-doctor decode-bench     measure video decoding speed
  odimac-doctor load             watch CPU use, temperatures and fan
  odimac-install /dev/DISK       install onto the internal disk (erases it)

